# Marks the two-tree repository honestly for diff, review and language-stat surfaces.
# See docs/LEGACY-TREES.md and docs/adr/0007-legacy-next-tree-disposition.md.
#
# The quarantined trees are real files that no user can reach. Without this, GitHub reports the
# legacy Next.js/TypeScript prototypes as the repository's primary language and expands them in
# review surfaces as if they were product code.
src/**                    linguist-vendored linguist-generated=false
*.tsx                     linguist-vendored
*.ts                      linguist-vendored
public/**                 linguist-vendored
deprecated/**             linguist-vendored

# Generated distribution artefact: rebuilt from app/** with `npm run build:standalone`.
# Committed for immediate download, never hand-edited.
LeadOS-standalone.html    linguist-generated

# Test evidence and scratch output are not source.
.tmp/**                   linguist-vendored
exports/**                linguist-vendored
reports/**                linguist-generated
eval-reports/**           linguist-generated
scenarios/**              linguist-vendored
